{"candidateAnswer":"Bittersweet, reflecting on the sacrifices the veterans had made.","evidence":"[D15:13 | 7:38 pm on 20 May, 2023] John: Thanks, Maria! We had a great time throwing a small party and inviting some veterans to share their stories. It was awesome seeing them make connections and find camaraderie. All the smiles and new friendships made it really heartwarming.","itemId":"urn:uuid:e3669dd3-7a6d-53c7-b92b-324b94bc52a1","provenance":{"sourceCommitment":"sha256:21c95fbabaaf5d47e92bd2b39e1c43bd55e114850f30e981679d244f5d2b8e69","timestamp":"2026-04-02T14:22:55Z"},"question":"What emotions did John feel during the small party with the veterans?","referenceAnswer":"heartwarming","sources":[{"digest":{"sha256":"21c95fbabaaf5d47e92bd2b39e1c43bd55e114850f30e981679d244f5d2b8e69"}}]}